---
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../config';
---

<section id="features" class="py-28 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0c0c0f] border-y border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle dark background glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-slate-200/50 via-transparent to-transparent dark:from-primary-900/10 dark:via-transparent dark:to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-sans font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        Every voice counts. <br/><span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Every bias is removed.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium font-sans mb-4">
        {SITE_DESCRIPTION}
      </p>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-sans">
        Animus is not a poll or an endless feed of arguments. It is a structured social network for the human mind, designed around reciprocity, anonymity, and graph relationships.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-rows-[minmax(260px,auto)_minmax(280px,auto)] gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Large Span 2x2 (Neo4j Graph Database) -->
      <div id="graph" class="md:col-span-2 lg:row-span-2 glass-panel p-8 flex flex-col reveal-on-scroll relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[420px] lg:min-h-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/40 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"></line></svg>`} />
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-sans font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 z-10">The Living Consensus Graph</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow z-10">
          Built on a native Neo4j graph database. When people ask identical or overlapping questions, Animus intelligently consolidates them into single knowledge nodes. The result is an unprecedented, living dataset of real human opinions, priorities, and societal concerns.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Decorative Graph / Cypher Block -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 dark:bg-[#111116] rounded-xl p-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary-300 shadow-xl border border-slate-700 dark:border-slate-800 z-10 transform transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1 duration-500">
          <div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
             <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700"></div>
             <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700"></div>
          </div>
          <code>MATCH (q:Question)-[:CONSENSUS]->(d:Demographics) RETURN q.title, d.ageGroup, d.breakdown</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Standard Span (Zero Bias) -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-8 flex flex-col reveal-on-scroll min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/40 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>`} />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Answer to Unlock</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          To see how the world thinks, you must commit your own answer first. No herd mentality, no prior influence, no seeing results beforehand. Pure, honest perspective.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Standard Span (Radical Privacy) -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-8 flex flex-col reveal-on-scroll min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/40 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>`} />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Radical Privacy</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          Your personal identity does not interest us. No names, phone numbers, or social graphs. Only high-level age brackets, gender, and general geography to reveal genuine demographic patterns.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Horizontal Span (Reciprocity Loop) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-start-3 lg:row-start-2 glass-panel p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-8 reveal-on-scroll min-h-[280px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
        <div class="flex-grow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/40 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>`} />
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-sans font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Reciprocal Engine: Give to Ask</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
            Every time you answer community questions, you earn participation credits. Those credits grant you the right to post your own questions and boost them across feeds. Millions of answers, zero spam, and authentic signal on topics that truly matter.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
